As said, poly will be hard to do properly, plus you'll have to re-poly
every so often if you don't have amulet of unchanging.

Boots of speed come really natutally, and you're gonna love them.
Gauntlets of dexterity cannot harm either.
Helm of brilliance (you never have enough INT with wizards).
wand of death may be handy both now and when you'll meet Rodney. Or, if
you have high enough INT/XL, a spellbook of finger of death (you'll get
one when (if) crowned, but having it now does not harm.
Maybe rather spellbook of magic missile would be a better offensive spell,
especially with low level creatures you are probably encountering
currently.
(of course, since you're a wizard you may want not to wih for
spellbooks/scrolls and rather try to write them once luck is maxed out...
your choice here)
Speaking of scrolls, if you don't know them, you may want scrolls of geno
in order to be able to write some and use them as weapon of mass
destruction when needed (say, cornered by ants).

