blanck scrolls/spellbooks and bless them, you'll definitely want to burns
markers on enchant *, geno, taming, finger of death, id, magic missile,
magic mapping or some other stuff.

If you want to wish for artefacts, go into the spoilers, halving damage
artefact can be nice, or frost brand (if you don't intend to use MB as a
main weapon).


Anyway, I'll definitely go for speed boots, they are one of the
